### Get all cargos
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllCargos HTTP/1.1

### Get cargo by ID (precisa de token)
POST http://localhost:40000/getCargoByID HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
    "cargoid": 1
}

### Insert cargo
POST http://localhost:40000/insertCargo HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
    "codigo": "AUX",
    "descricao": "Auxiliar Administrativo",
    "salario_base": 2500.00,
    "ativo": true
}

### Update cargo
POST http://localhost:40000/updateCargo HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
    "cargoid": 5,
    "codigo": "AUX",
    "descricao": "Auxiliar Administrativo Sênior",
    "salario_base": 2800.00,
    "ativo": true
}

